17592186045417 true] [17592186420993 1083 #uuid "ae277bb1-236f-56f1-8a0c-7fd47295108c" 13194139534425 17592186045417 true] [17592186420994 1080 "-1" 13194139534425 17592186045417 true] [17592186420994 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139534425 17592186045417 true] [17592186420994 1083 #uuid "d87585d5-b5cd-5fbc-b58c-a3d2c45f4e66" 13194139534425 17592186045417 true] [17592186420995 1075 #edb/ref 17592186420990 13194139534425 17592186045417 true] [17592186420995 1075 #edb/ref 17592186420991 13194139534425 17592186045417 true] [17592186420995 1075 #edb/ref 17592186420992 13194139534425 17592186045417 true] [17592186420995 1075 #edb/ref 17592186420993 13194139534425 17592186045417 true] [17592186420995 1075 #edb/ref 17592186420994 13194139534425 17592186045417 true] [17592186420995 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139534425 17592186045417 true] [17592186420995 1077 "selection" 13194139534425 17592186045417 true] [17592186420995 1078 #edb/ref 17592186420993 13194139534425 17592186045417 true] [17592186420995 1079 #uuid "f118ee24-10a3-5bda-8238-4be0365cace0" 13194139534425 17592186045417 true] [17592186420996 1068 #edb/ref 17592186420995 13194139534425 17592186045417 true] [17592186420996 1069 "q-37206" 13194139534425 17592186045417 true] [17592186420996 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045486 13194139534425 17592186045417 true] [17592186420996 1071 "Let $f(x,y,z)=xy+yz+{z}^{2},$ where $x={s}^{2}+{t}^{2},$ $y=\\frac{s}{t}$ and $z=s{t}^{2}.$ Given that\n\n$$\n\\frac{∂f}{∂s}=\\frac{3{s}^{2}}{t}+{c}_{1}t+{c}_{2}st+{c}_{3}s{t}^{4},\n$$\n\nfind the value of ${c}_{1}+{c}_{2}+{c}_{3}.$" 13194139534425 17592186045417 true] [17592186420996 1072 #uuid "f22c7a35-af74-59c8-b71b-cae8347ea97d" 13194139534425 17592186045417 true] [17592186420996 1074 "![](images/be/be6afcdd0ad9ae0d7ef377c4918442a64e1186c90c25e27ec6c224d816a602fd.png)\n\nThe chain rule for a multivariable function $f(x,y,z)$ with two independent variables $s$ and $t,$ where $x=x(s,t),y=y(s,t)$ and $z=z(s,t),$ can be expressed as follows:\n\n$$\n\\frac{∂f}{∂s}=\\frac{∂f}{∂x}\\cdot \\frac{∂x}{∂s}+\\frac{∂f}{∂y}\\cdot \\frac{∂y}{∂s}+\\frac{∂f}{∂z}\\cdot \\frac{∂z}{∂s}\n$$\n\nFirst, we find the partial derivatives of $f$ with respect to $x,y$ and $z:$ \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂f}{∂x}=y,\\,\\frac{∂f}{∂y}=x+z,\\,\\frac{∂f}{∂z}=y+2z.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWriting the above results in terms of $s$ and $t,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂f}{∂x} & =\\frac{s}{t}, \\\\ \\frac{∂f}{∂y} & ={s}^{2}+{t}^{2}+s{t}^{2}, \\\\ \\frac{∂f}{∂z} & =\\frac{s}{t}+2s{t}^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we take the derivatives of $x,$ $y,$ and $z$ with respect to $s,$ and we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂x}{∂s} & =2s, \\\\ \\frac{∂y}{∂s} & =\\frac{1}{t}, \\\\ \\frac{∂z}{∂s} & ={t}^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting all of our derivatives into the multivariable chain rule, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂f}{∂s} & =(\\frac{s}{t})\\cdot 2s+({s}^{2}+{t}^{2}+s{t}^{2})\\cdot \\frac{1}{t}+(\\frac{s}{t}+2s{t}^{2})\\cdot {t}^{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{2{s}^{2}}{t}+\\frac{{s}^{2}}{t}+t+st+st+2s{t}^{4} \\\\  & =\\frac{3{s}^{2}}{t}+t+2st+2s{t}^{4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, ${c}_{1}=1,$ ${c}_{2}=2$ and ${c}_{3}=2,$ and therefore\n\n$$\n{c}_{1}+{c}_{2}+{c}_{3}=1+2+2=5.\n$$" 13194139534425 17592186045417 true] [17592186420997 1058 #edb/ref 17592186421000 13194139534425 17592186045417 true] [17592186420997 1062 #uuid "2cf7698e-82a3-5979-93cb-d2edffbb99d7" 13194139534425 17592186045417 true] [17592186420997 1063 #edb/ref 17592186167325 13194139534425 17592186045417 true] [17592186420998 1058 #edb/ref 17592186421001 13194139534425 17592186045417 true] [17592186420998 1062 #uuid "6a9db776-142d-5ace-9b62-834d4e4b6a63" 13194139534425 17592186045417 true] [17592186420998 1063 #edb/ref 17592186323885 13194139534425 17592186045417 true] [17592186420999 1062 #uuid "6ef0c797-03b2-58eb-8a37-83236f476fe8" 13194139534425 17592186045417 true] [17592186420999 1063 #edb/ref 17592186284667 13194139534425 17592186045417 true] [175